There are $todoentries<<if $logdebug is 1>> and $todominorentries less important<</if>> things you could write about <<if $diarywriteday lt $days-1>>and it's been <<print $days-$diarywriteday>> days since your last entry.<</if>>
Would you like to write a new entry or just read old ones.<br><br>
<<link [[Write (0:10+)|Write Diary]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Read (0:05)|Diary]]>><</link>><br>
[[SD|Simple Diary]]<br>
